The following files are available for FREQ on my BBS:

Magicname       Description
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
CHATADD   (5k)  ChatAdder v1.00 - A program with the simple task of
                increasing the number of Sysop pages a user has done.
                Useful for including in your chat-batch file when using a
                sysop page door which doesn't do this. Pascal source
                included.

ENQUETE   (9k)  Enquete v1.2b - An AREXX voting booth written in the Dutch
                language. Very colorful with a lot of nice features. It
                may take a while before you've converted it to English, but
                it's worth the trouble.

BIRTH     (2k)  Arexx script which creates a list of soon happening
                birthdays from the userdata on your BBS. A lot of bugs are
                removed from this version. (The old one was a little buggy)

GUESS    (18k)  MensenRaden v1.1 - Dutch doorgame based on the Animal
                Guessing game. From a database made by the users, it tries
                to guess the person you're thinking about. Source included
                (KickPascal) so you can translate it into any language you
                like. Should be no problem.

RDMON    (27k)  Red Dwarf Monitor v1.03 - Fully featured who's online door
                with broadcast capture, send node message option, view user
                option and broadcast buffer. !!Final version!! Source is
		included, and you may do with it whatever you want...

SOKOBAN  (35k)  Sokoban v1.1 - Dutch AREXX door. Based on the normal
                Sokoban puzzle game. Features 63 levels to clear! You
                should have no problems translating it (simple remove all
                text in the levels and create your own instruction screen).
                However, it may take you a while to do it. Very nice!

TIMEBANK (35k)  Timbank v1.31 - A timebank written especially for DLG Pro.
                Has only the 'normal' features, but is fully configurable
                by the Sysop and has broadcast capture :-).
                2 Minute warning DLG limit has been removed! (Users with
                less than 2 minutes can still use the timebank correctly).
		This release includes sourcecode, since I'll probably
		translate it to Dutch and no new features are needed IMHO.

TYPER    (85k)  HyperTyper v2.20 - A action typing doorgame with a lot of
                nice features. Including: Single player mode, Battle mode
                against a user on another node, Chatmode after battle,
                Paging system with built-in who's online, Statistics
                viewer, User-inform if their personal single player
                record is broken by someone and broadcast capture.
                Shareware (IT IS WORTH IT!)

USERM    (31k)  UserMessage v2.5 - Full featured usermessage door in
                which users can create full-ansi usermessages. Lots of
                nice features included!

VIEWTEXT (20k)  ViewText v1.00 - Textview program like MsgCmd, but users
                have the ability to download texts, and instead of the
                filecomment, a datafile is used. Some Dutch text, but
                C-source is included.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

NOTES:

All programs above are written by me, and are requestable at
+31-2510-47830 (Amynet 39:151/105.0). If you don't carry Amy, just create
a fake node for my telephone numberin your nodelist.

If someone convertes a door to another language, please drop it off on my
BBS so others won't have to do what you already did.

If somebody freqs a file, please distribute it to other local DLG owners.

Problems? Mail them to me...

                                                  Signed,

